    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Forf">Forf.</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hit ðonne elles on hydelse funden sy, ðonne mæg þæt forfangfeoh leohtre beon, forðam bið on læsse plihte begytan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If [stolen] property is found in a hidden [but nearer?] place, then the reward may be less, because it was recovered with less trouble.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si uero aliter inueniatur occultum, tunc potest forfang esse minoris precii, quia minori fuit periculo conquisitum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
